<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction two bln skr in five-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction two bln skr in five-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Debt Office on Wednesday invited bids for two billion crowns of five-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 1030 GMT on July 16.</p>
<p>						  Bond 1039</p>
<p> Maturity date				 April 12, 2002</p>
<p> Coupon					  5.50</p>
<p> Volume to market (Billions Skr)	 2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			     July 21, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
